OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre revamp could get
OL,4,A#8m council loan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn a former Scarborough
OL,7,Fshopping centre into a leisure
OL,8,Fdestination could receive a council
OL,9,Floan of #8m.
OL,11,FThe Brunswick Centre closed in
OL,12,FSeptember last year for redevelopment,
OL,13,Fwhich aims to create a six-screen
OL,14,Fcinema, food and drink outlets and new
OL,15,Fretail units.
OL,17,FNorth Yorkshire Council said the
OL,18,Fproposals had the potential to
OL,19,Ftransform a large vacant site into a
OL,20,F"vibrant destination" and a loan would
OL,21,Fhelp the developer attract commercial
OL,22,Finvestment.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
